graph\" >To get closer to the escape exit, you need to get in the elevator and go to the <u><strong>2nd floor</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you go to the wrong floor even once, all of your progress will be reset, and you will be forcibly returned to the starting point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the elevator correctly in succession and reach the escape exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/31cac60770fa86b1cfc2fdf2e1d8a113.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.poster.avif?t=1748759011\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.webm?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/extras/6840dd6cc9d20b27b716e60a7eadfc13.mp4?t=1748759011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["TAYUTA CREATE"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737310/36a8b9cb5ebf